{"step_index":360,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-26T10:33:22Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-26T10:33:22Z\nCompleted At: 2026-10-26T10:33:23Z\nCommand exited with code 0.\n\nCommand output:\n//! Consolidated Operation gRPC bridge.\r\n//!\r\n//! The former `op-grpc-bridge-zeroclaw` entry point is folded into this main\r\n//! service. It exposes the complete Operation route set plus the zeroclow Router\r\n//! schema API on TCP port 8090 and the plugin Unix socket.\r\n\r\nuse op_grpc_bridge::server::{ServerConfig, run_chat_router_server};\r\n\r\n#[tokio::main]\r\nasync fn main() -> anyhow::Result<()> {\r\n    let _ = rustls::crypto::aws_lc_rs::default_provider().install_default();\r\n\r\n    tracing_subscriber::fmt()\r\n        .with_env_filter(\r\n            tracing_subscriber::EnvFilter::try_from_default_env()\r\n                .unwrap_or_else(|_| tracing_subscriber::EnvFilter::new(\"warn\")),\r\n        )\r\n        .init();\r\n\r\n    let config = ServerConfig::from_env();\r\n    tracing::info!(\r\n        plugin_id = %config.plugin_id,\r\n        schema_path = %config.schema_path.display(),\r\n        unix_socket = %config.unix_socket.display(),\r\n        shared_socket = %config.shared_socket.display(),\r\n        bind_addr = %config.bind_addr,\r\n        tls = config.tls_identity.is_some(),\r\n        \"Consolidated Operation gRPC bridge starting (tonic TLS MQTT/gRPC demux)\"\r\n    );\r\n    run_chat_router_server(config).await\r\n}\r\n"}
